webkit_web_process_extension
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The native extension under ext/webkit_web_process_extension links webkit_web_process_extension, the Rust
implementation of the Olm and Megolm cryptographic ratchets. This gem is
bindings for it and nothing else: every class it defines wraps a type of that
crate.

